Package: mcp.console
Title: Use MCP Console with Typed Session Configuration
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Tomasz", "Kalinowski", , "kalinowskit@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Adds MCP Console to an 'ellmer' chat as a persistent workbench
    for R, Python, and DuckDB. Provides typed session configuration and
    sandbox permissions through the Console command-line interface.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://posit-dev.github.io/mcp-console/r/,
